  "releaseNotes": "- PDTimeline: added opt-in Follow Now support that anchors the viewport and rolling selection to the live right edge, pauses on user navigation, and includes a toolbar toggle and live seconds-scale demo (BC-91).\n      - PDModal: fixed a Bootstrap .modal-backdrop being left orphaned on the page when a modal was open and the user navigated away (e.g. browser Back), which dimmed the page, prevented scrolling and blocked all interaction. Bootstrap only removes the backdrop on its animated hidden.bs.modal event, which loses the race against Blazor's page teardown. PDModal now hides itself on navigation (new HideOnNavigation parameter, default true) and synchronously clears any stray backdrop and restores the body via a new cleanupBackdrops() interop, so cleanup no longer depends on the animation completing. Set HideOnNavigation=\"false\" to keep a modal open across navigation.",
